menu "Cottage development"
    config COTTAGE_SIMULATOR_NETWORK
        bool "Connect to the FoloToy simulator host bridge"
        default n
        help
            Development-only firmware: connect to the open Emulator Host Bridge
            access point at startup, using RAM-only Wi-Fi configuration. Forget
            disconnects until setup is requested or the simulator restarts.
            Do not enable this option for physical-device firmware.
endmenu
